{"actor":"MYRADhub","comment":null,"created_at":"2026-08-19T18:29:07Z","event_type":"updated","id":125,"issue_id":"bd_49Agents-jt4.14","new_value":"{\"design\":\"CORRECTION: this issue is invalid as filed and should be closed.\\n\\nThe original diagnosis blamed touch for the failure. Re-testing under device emulation shows the placement path does work on touch: a tap on the canvas in placement mode delivers a click to #canvas-container (Chromium synthesises mousemove then click from the tap), handlePlacementClick runs, the ghost is removed and createFn is called. handlePlacementClick also has a fallback for the no-hover case, computing the position straight from e.clientX/e.clientY, so it does not depend on a prior mousemove having set snappedX/snappedY.\\n\\nThe real reason no pane appeared in the probe is that every pane type is created through agentRequest -- createNotePane posts to /api/notes (src-client/modules/pane-creation.js:993) -- and the e2e environment has no agent connected over the WebSocket. Nothing to do with touch or mobile.\\n\\nThe e2e suite still seeds panes through window.TC2_DEBUG, but for that reason rather than the one originally recorded.\"}","old_value":"{\"id\":\"bd_49Agents-jt4.14\",\"title\":\"Placement mode cannot complete on a touch device\",\"description\":\"Creating any pane enters placement mode (src-client/modules/placement.js:58), which positions the ghost from mousemove and commits on a canvas-container click. A touch device produces neither: there is no mousemove before the tap, so snappedX/snappedY are never set, and the tap does not arrive as the click the handler expects.\\n\\nThe practical effect is that the add-pane menu opens and the ghost appears, but no pane can be created by touch. Confirmed under Playwright device emulation, where the add -\\u003e note -\\u003e tap-canvas sequence leaves state.panes empty; the e2e suite has to seed panes through window.TC2_DEBUG as a result.\\n\\nThis makes it the most severe mobile gap found so far: the app cannot be used to create anything on a phone.\",\"acceptance_criteria\":\"Tapping the canvas in placement mode creates the pane at the tapped position on a touch device, with a sensible position when no hover has occurred. Covered by an e2e spec under device emulation that drives the real add-pane flow.\",\"status\":\"open\",\"priority\":1,\"issue_type\":\"task\",\"owner\":\"myradism@gmail.com\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-19T21:31:36Z\",\"created_by\":\"MYRADhub\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-19T21:31:36Z\"}"}
